[
    {
        "TextId": 1,
        "ActorName": "Experienced Stylist",
        "ActorTalk": "We'll help Lucia pick out the perfect coatings for her. As for the final look, please check it out with the Gray Raven Commandant.",
        "Cv": 510000171.0,
        "Desc": null
    },
    {
        "TextId": 2,
        "ActorName": "Experienced Stylist",
        "ActorTalk": "If I had to pick, I'd recommend the high ponytail first.",
        "Cv": 510000172.0,
        "Desc": null
    },
    {
        "TextId": 3,
        "ActorName": "Experienced Stylist",
        "ActorTalk": "It's clean and sharp. Perfectly matches your style. It won't get in the way during combat, and it brings out your confident side. A great mix of practicality and flair.",
        "Cv": 510000173.0,
        "Desc": null
    },
    {
        "TextId": 4,
        "ActorName": "Lucia",
        "ActorTalk": "It does feel sleek and unrestrictive. What do you think, Commandant?",
        "Cv": 510000174.0,
        "Desc": null
    },
    {
        "TextId": 5,
        "ActorName": "Experienced Stylist",
        "ActorTalk": "Since you're here to explore new looks, you've got to try a few! Next up is the hair bun.",
        "Cv": 510000178.0,
        "Desc": null
    },
    {
        "TextId": 6,
        "ActorName": "Experienced Stylist",
        "ActorTalk": "It's light and lively, adds a playful touch, and gives off an easygoing and approachable vibe. The whole look is full of energy with a hint of charm. Definitely worth a try.",
        "Cv": 510000179.0,
        "Desc": null
    },
    {
        "TextId": 7,
        "ActorName": "Lucia",
        "ActorTalk": "Isn't this style a bit over-the-top for me? What do you think, Commandant?",
        "Cv": 510000180.0,
        "Desc": null
    },
    {
        "TextId": 8,
        "ActorName": "Experienced Stylist",
        "ActorTalk": "And finally, we have the sleek and elegant straight hair style.",
        "Cv": 510000184.0,
        "Desc": null
    },
    {
        "TextId": 9,
        "ActorName": "Experienced Stylist",
        "ActorTalk": "The hair falls smoothly and naturally, giving off a composed, graceful air. It highlights your calm demeanor while adding a touch of quiet softness. It brings out your personality and works perfectly for everyday wear.",
        "Cv": 510000185.0,
        "Desc": null
    },
    {
        "TextId": 10,
        "ActorName": "Lucia",
        "ActorTalk": "I remember when we first met, my hair was like this... What do you think, Commandant?",
        "Cv": 510000186.0,
        "Desc": null
    },
    {
        "TextId": 11,
        "ActorName": "Lucia",
        "ActorTalk": "We've tried all the recommended styles. Was there one you liked best, Commandant?",
        "Cv": 510000190.0,
        "Desc": null
    },
    {
        "TextId": 12,
        "ActorName": "Lucia",
        "ActorTalk": "Oh, by the way, Commandant, the shop also has lots of coating outfits you can try on...",
        "Cv": 510000194.0,
        "Desc": null
    },
    {
        "TextId": 13,
        "ActorName": "Lucia",
        "ActorTalk": "Really? Then maybe I'll wear it more often.",
        "Cv": 510000175.0,
        "Desc": null
    },
    {
        "TextId": 14,
        "ActorName": "Lucia",
        "ActorTalk": "Well... I'll take that as a yes.",
